  "question": {
    "text": "A particle just clears a wall of height $b$ at distance $a$ and strikes the ground at a distance $c$ from the point of projection. The angle of projection is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "6zAUG",
      "text": "\n$\\tan ^{-1} \\frac{b}{a c}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "umUm9",
      "text": "\n$45^{\\circ}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cvKlf",
      "text": "\n$\\tan ^{-1} \\frac{b c}{a(c-a)}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "WDM3C",
      "text": "\n$\\tan ^{-1} \\frac{b c}{a}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$a=(u \\cos \\alpha) t$ and $b=(u \\sin \\alpha) t-\\frac{1}{2} g t^2$\n$b=a \\tan \\alpha-\\frac{1}{2} g \\frac{a^2}{u^2 \\cos ^2 \\alpha}$\nalso, $c=\\frac{u^2 \\sin 2 \\alpha}{g}$\n$b=a \\tan \\alpha-\\frac{a^2 g}{2}\\left(\\frac{\\sin 2 \\alpha}{c g}\\right) \\sec ^2 \\alpha$\n$b=a \\tan \\alpha-\\frac{a^2}{2 c} 2 \\tan \\alpha$\n$\\Rightarrow\\left(a-\\frac{a^2}{c}\\right) \\tan \\alpha=b$\n$\\tan \\alpha=\\frac{b c}{a(c-a)}$.\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/doAlyaqjivzSbCjYYYD_e7QN3HIihTh66qUyqIPqR4U.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
